  idegaa      : Intraclass factorization degree                            =   1
  idegab      : Interclass factorization degree                            =   2
  idgaal      : Intraclass degree for last class                           =   1
  nclas2      : Number of arbitrary classes of equation blocks             =   2
  nprosl      : Number of classes for parallelization of scaling and                                  
